{"bendscript":"0.1","blocks":[{"id":"blk-280","kind":"heading","level":1,"spans":[{"id":"spn-567","text":"The Compose Runtime — CC2 "},{"id":"spn-568","marks":["code"],"text":"compose"},{"id":"spn-569","text":", made authorable (design note)"}]},{"id":"blk-281","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-570","marks":["bold"],"text":"Status:"},{"id":"spn-571","text":" design proposal · "},{"id":"spn-572","marks":["bold"],"text":"Reviewable against:"},{"id":"spn-573","text":" "},{"id":"spn-574","marks":["code"],"text":"CC2-capability-composition.md"},{"id":"spn-575","text":" (§2 operators, §3 coalition), "},{"id":"spn-576","marks":["code"],"text":"UMBRELLA.md"},{"id":"spn-577","text":" (the "},{"id":"spn-578","marks":["code"],"text":"compose"},{"id":"spn-579","text":" stage), "},{"id":"spn-580","marks":["code"],"text":"box-and-box"},{"id":"spn-581","text":" (8 rungs / 103 laws) · "},{"id":"spn-582","marks":["bold"],"text":"Surface home:"},{"id":"spn-583","text":" "},{"id":"spn-584","marks":["code"],"text":"weave/forge.html"},{"id":"spn-585","text":" (the lego canvas) · "},{"id":"spn-586","marks":["bold"],"text":"Runtime home:"},{"id":"spn-587","text":" "},{"id":"spn-588","marks":["code"],"text":"AmpersandBoxDesign/box-and-box/"},{"id":"spn-589","text":" (new "},{"id":"spn-590","marks":["code"],"text":"compose.mjs"},{"id":"spn-591","text":")"}]},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-283","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-592","text":"One line: turn the "},{"id":"spn-593","marks":["bold"],"text":"one unfinished stage of the [&] pipeline"},{"id":"spn-594","text":" — "},{"id":"spn-595","marks":["code"],"text":"compose"},{"id":"spn-596","text":" (lawless "},{"id":"spn-597","marks":["code"],"text":"|>"},{"id":"spn-598","text":", no coalition runtime) — into a small lawful runtime, and make it authorable in the Forge as bricks you snap together. Each brick carries *invariant · laws · enforcement · feedback · adaptation*; composing bricks yields another brick. The verdict is the arithmetic."}]}],"id":"blk-282","kind":"quote"},{"id":"blk-284","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-599","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-285","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-600","text":"1. Why this, why now"}]},{"id":"blk-286","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-601","marks":["code"],"text":"UMBRELLA.md"},{"id":"spn-602","text":" lists seven stages: "},{"id":"spn-603","marks":["code"],"text":"declare → validate → compose → govern → wire → run → observe"},{"id":"spn-604","text":". Every stage has a shipped engine "},{"id":"spn-605","marks":["bold"],"text":"except `compose`"},{"id":"spn-606","text":", which is marked *\""},{"id":"spn-607","marks":["code"],"text":"&"},{"id":"spn-608","text":" ✅ · "},{"id":"spn-609","marks":["code"],"text":"|>"},{"id":"spn-610","text":" still lawless · cross-agent coalition compose ❌.\"* "},{"id":"spn-611","marks":["code"],"text":"CC2-capability-composition.md"},{"id":"spn-612","text":" already specifies the missing piece normatively ("},{"id":"spn-613","marks":["code"],"text":"&"},{"id":"spn-614","text":" lattice, "},{"id":"spn-615","marks":["code"],"text":"|>"},{"id":"spn-616","text":" governed monoid, the coalition object, rung-by-rung admissibility) — but it is "},{"id":"spn-617","marks":["bold"],"text":"draft, no runtime"},{"id":"spn-618","text":": schema + "},{"id":"spn-619","marks":["code"],"text":"box-and-box lift"},{"id":"spn-620","text":" exist, the compose runtime and lawful "},{"id":"spn-621","marks":["code"],"text":"|>"},{"id":"spn-622","text":" do not."}]},{"id":"blk-287","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-623","text":"So this is not a new language. It is the "},{"id":"spn-624","marks":["bold"],"text":"runtime + authoring surface for a spec we already wrote."},{"id":"spn-625","text":" The user's \"compose stacks like legos (invariant + laws + enforcement + feedback + adaptation)\" maps exactly onto CC2 compose."}]},{"id":"blk-288","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-626","text":"The five facets already have engines (nothing greenfield)"}]},{"head":[{"id":"blk-290","spans":[{"id":"spn-627","text":"facet"}]},{"id":"blk-291","spans":[{"id":"spn-628","text":"engine that provides it"}]},{"id":"blk-292","spans":[{"id":"spn-629","text":"symbol"}]}],"id":"blk-289","kind":"table","rows":[[{"id":"blk-293","spans":[{"id":"spn-630","marks":["bold"],"text":"invariant"}]},{"id":"blk-294","spans":[{"id":"spn-631","text":"Weave cost certificate ("},{"id":"spn-632","marks":["code"],"text":"classify"},{"id":"spn-633","text":"/"},{"id":"spn-634","marks":["code"],"text":"inferEAL"},{"id":"spn-635","text":") + alethic "},{"id":"spn-636","marks":["code"],"text":"consume"},{"id":"spn-637","text":" → "},{"id":"spn-638","marks":["code"],"text":"0̲"}]},{"id":"blk-295","spans":[{"id":"spn-639","text":"the floor"}]}],[{"id":"blk-296","spans":[{"id":"spn-640","marks":["bold"],"text":"laws"}]},{"id":"blk-297","spans":[{"id":"spn-641","marks":["code"],"text":"box-and-box"},{"id":"spn-642","text":" 103 property-tested laws ("},{"id":"spn-643","marks":["code"],"text":"test/laws.mjs"},{"id":"spn-644","text":")"}]},{"id":"blk-298","spans":[{"id":"spn-645","text":"the algebra"}]}],[{"id":"blk-299","spans":[{"id":"spn-646","marks":["bold"],"text":"enforcement"}]},{"id":"blk-300","spans":[{"id":"spn-647","text":"the bridge "},{"id":"spn-648","marks":["code"],"text":"select(...)"},{"id":"spn-649","text":" — "},{"id":"spn-650","marks":["code"],"text":"feasible ▸ permitted ▸ best"}]},{"id":"blk-301","spans":[{"id":"spn-651","text":"the verdict"}]}],[{"id":"blk-302","spans":[{"id":"spn-652","marks":["bold"],"text":"feedback"}]},{"id":"blk-303","spans":[{"id":"spn-653","marks":["code"],"text":"observe"},{"id":"spn-654","text":" stage — "},{"id":"spn-655","marks":["code"],"text":"evolution.mjs"},{"id":"spn-656","text":" provenance hash-chain + PULSE bus"}]},{"id":"blk-304","spans":[{"id":"spn-657","text":"the trace"}]}],[{"id":"blk-305","spans":[{"id":"spn-658","marks":["bold"],"text":"adaptation"}]},{"id":"blk-306","spans":[{"id":"spn-659","marks":["code"],"text":"evolution.mjs"},{"id":"spn-660","text":" "},{"id":"spn-661","marks":["code"],"text":"evolve()"},{"id":"spn-662","text":" — measured/priced/certified change (EV1–EV6)"}]},{"id":"blk-307","spans":[{"id":"spn-663","text":"the rewrite"}]}]]},{"id":"blk-308","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-664","marks":["bold"],"text":"Crucial finding (de-risks v1):"},{"id":"spn-665","text":" "},{"id":"spn-666","marks":["code"],"text":"value.mjs"},{"id":"spn-667","text":" already exports the operators CC2 needs — "},{"id":"spn-668","marks":["code"],"text":"combine(a,b)"},{"id":"spn-669","text":" (the "},{"id":"spn-670","marks":["code"],"text":"&"},{"id":"spn-671","text":" lattice merge), "},{"id":"spn-672","marks":["code"],"text":"chain(a,b)"},{"id":"spn-673","text":" (the sequential, phase-graded "},{"id":"spn-674","marks":["code"],"text":"|>"},{"id":"spn-675","text":"), and "},{"id":"spn-676","marks":["code"],"text":"consume(v,req)"},{"id":"spn-677","text":" (the alethic gate that produces "},{"id":"spn-678","marks":["code"],"text":"0̲"},{"id":"spn-679","text":"). CC2's "},{"id":"spn-680","marks":["code"],"text":"&"},{"id":"spn-681","text":"/"},{"id":"spn-682","marks":["code"],"text":"|>"},{"id":"spn-683","text":" are these *lifted from raw Values to capabilities-with-holder-and-contract.* The hard algebra is done; v1 is a thin lift + a type-compatibility check + a surface."}]},{"id":"blk-309","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-684","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-310","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-685","text":"2. The brick (the unit of composition)"}]},{"id":"blk-311","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-686","text":"A "},{"id":"spn-687","marks":["bold"],"text":"brick"},{"id":"spn-688","text":" is a capability annotated with everything needed to compose it lawfully:"}]},{"id":"blk-312","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"Brick = {\n  id, holder,                       // who provides it (CC2 provenance tag)\n  contract: { accepts_from, feeds_into },   // the |> hand-off types\n  value: V({ pi, beta, kappa, sigma }),     // alethic modal value (box-and-box)\n  cost:  WeaveCostCertificate,              // the invariant — see §2.1 (the atom this whole layer rests on)\n  utility,                                   // axiological score input\n  laws:  [...lawIds],                        // which rung laws it claims (conformance)\n  floor: [...forbidden],                     // un-weakenable deontic/reflexive constraints\n}"},{"id":"blk-313","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-689","text":"A brick is exactly the [&] "},{"id":"spn-690","marks":["code"],"text":"CC1"},{"id":"spn-691","text":" capability + holder (CC2 §2.1) + its Weave cost cert. The five facets are all present: cost = invariant, laws = laws, value/floor = enforcement inputs, and the brick gains feedback/adaptation when wrapped in a loop (§3, "},{"id":"spn-692","marks":["code"],"text":"⟲"},{"id":"spn-693","text":")."}]},{"id":"blk-314","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-694","text":"2.1 "},{"id":"spn-695","marks":["code"],"text":"WeaveCostCertificate"},{"id":"spn-696","text":" — the "},{"id":"spn-697","marks":["code"],"text":"Brick.cost"},{"id":"spn-698","text":" contract (build this FIRST)"}]},{"id":"blk-315","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-699","text":"The certificate is the atom; the compose runtime is the molecule. It must exist before any composition. Canonical, IR-hash-bound, "},{"id":"spn-700","marks":["bold"],"text":"fail-closed"},{"id":"spn-701","text":":"}]},{"id":"blk-316","kind":"code","language":"ts","text":"type WeaveCostCertificate = {\n  subject:  { kind: \"weave-ir\"; hash: string };          // cert is BOUND to the IR hash;\n                                                          // any IR change invalidates it\n  analyzer: { name: \"weave-eal\" | \"weave-classify\" | \"weave-lal\"; version: string };\n  verdict:  {\n    certified:  boolean;       // did analysis succeed with a real bound?\n    total:      boolean;       // termination guaranteed\n    oracleFree: boolean;       // eal:true ⟹ reduces with no residual superposition\n    costClass:  \"poly\" | \"elementary\" | \"exponential\" | \"tower\" | \"unknown\";\n    ealDepth?:  number;        // certified elementary tower height (weave-eal)\n    polynomialDegree?: number; // measured today (weave-eal-degree); PROVEN once static LAL lands\n    rank?:      number;        // legacy STLC type-order proxy ONLY — not the certificate's class\n  };\n  policy:   { resourceDecision: \"allow\" | \"budget_check\" | \"escalate\" | \"annihilate\"; reason: string };\n  evidence: { source?: string; generatedAt: string; /* space for signer/signature later */ };\n};"},{"id":"blk-317","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-702","marks":["bold"],"text":"Canonical vocabulary (one set, no synonyms):"},{"id":"spn-703","text":" "},{"id":"spn-704","marks":["code"],"text":"costClass"},{"id":"spn-705","text":", "},{"id":"spn-706","marks":["code"],"text":"ealDepth"},{"id":"spn-707","text":", "},{"id":"spn-708","marks":["code"],"text":"polynomialDegree"},{"id":"spn-709","text":", "},{"id":"spn-710","marks":["code"],"text":"certified"},{"id":"spn-711","text":", "},{"id":"spn-712","marks":["code"],"text":"oracleFree"},{"id":"spn-713","text":", "},{"id":"spn-714","marks":["code"],"text":"total"},{"id":"spn-715","text":". Keep "},{"id":"spn-716","marks":["code"],"text":"rank"},{"id":"spn-717","text":" *only* for the older STLC proxy. ("},{"id":"spn-718","marks":["code"],"text":"classify"},{"id":"spn-719","text":" currently returns "},{"id":"spn-720","marks":["code"],"text":"{rank, rung, terr}"},{"id":"spn-721","text":"; the certificate maps "},{"id":"spn-722","marks":["code"],"text":"rung → costClass"},{"id":"spn-723","text":" and surfaces "},{"id":"spn-724","marks":["code"],"text":"eal"},{"id":"spn-725","text":"/"},{"id":"spn-726","marks":["code"],"text":"depth"},{"id":"spn-727","text":" from "},{"id":"spn-728","marks":["code"],"text":"inferEAL"},{"id":"spn-729","text":".)"}]},{"id":"blk-318","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-730","marks":["bold"],"text":"Fail-closed is the default."},{"id":"spn-731","text":" Uncertified / non-total / non-oracle-free / analyzer-error ⇒ "},{"id":"spn-732","marks":["code"],"text":"resourceDecision: \"annihilate\""},{"id":"spn-733","text":" ("},{"id":"spn-734","marks":["code"],"text":"0̲"},{"id":"spn-735","text":"). "},{"id":"spn-736","marks":["bold"],"text":"Uncertified is vetoed, not a low score"},{"id":"spn-737","text":" — utility can never resurrect it (this is the whole point of the floor). An explicit "},{"id":"spn-738","marks":["code"],"text":"mode: \"production\" | \"development\""},{"id":"spn-739","text":" may downgrade "},{"id":"spn-740","marks":["code"],"text":"unknown → warn/override"},{"id":"spn-741","text":" in dev, but "},{"id":"spn-742","marks":["bold"],"text":"production unknown → `0̲`"},{"id":"spn-743","text":", always."}]},{"id":"blk-319","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-744","marks":["bold"],"text":"Resource-rung mapping"},{"id":"spn-745","text":" (the "},{"id":"spn-746","marks":["code"],"text":"policy.resourceDecision"},{"id":"spn-747","text":"):"}]},{"head":[{"id":"blk-321","spans":[{"id":"spn-748","text":"static result"}]},{"id":"blk-322","spans":[{"id":"spn-749","text":"decision"}]}],"id":"blk-320","kind":"table","rows":[[{"id":"blk-323","spans":[{"id":"spn-750","marks":["code"],"text":"poly"},{"id":"spn-751","text":" / "},{"id":"spn-752","marks":["code"],"text":"ealDepth ≤ 1"},{"id":"spn-753","text":" with safe bounds"}]},{"id":"blk-324","spans":[{"id":"spn-754","marks":["code"],"text":"allow"}]}],[{"id":"blk-325","spans":[{"id":"spn-755","marks":["code"],"text":"elementary"},{"id":"spn-756","text":" above the cheap rung"}]},{"id":"blk-326","spans":[{"id":"spn-757","marks":["code"],"text":"budget_check"},{"id":"spn-758","text":" / "},{"id":"spn-759","marks":["code"],"text":"escalate"}]}],[{"id":"blk-327","spans":[{"id":"spn-760","marks":["code"],"text":"exponential"},{"id":"spn-761","text":" / "},{"id":"spn-762","marks":["code"],"text":"tower"}]},{"id":"blk-328","spans":[{"id":"spn-763","marks":["code"],"text":"escalate"},{"id":"spn-764","text":" / cheaper-plan route"}]}],[{"id":"blk-329","spans":[{"id":"spn-765","text":"uncertified / not total / not oracle-free / analyzer error"}]},{"id":"blk-330","spans":[{"id":"spn-766","marks":["code"],"text":"annihilate"},{"id":"spn-767","text":" ("},{"id":"spn-768","marks":["code"],"text":"0̲"},{"id":"spn-769","text":")"}]}]]},{"id":"blk-331","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-770","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-332","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-771","text":"3. The connectors (the lego studs) — and their laws"}]},{"id":"blk-333","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-772","text":"Four operators. The first two are CC2 §2; the laws are *already* the box-and-box value laws, lifted."}]},{"id":"blk-334","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-773","marks":["code"],"text":"&"},{"id":"spn-774","text":" — combine (parallel) → "},{"id":"spn-775","marks":["code"],"text":"combine"}]},{"id":"blk-335","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-776","text":"Merge the joint capability set. Lattice join, holder-tagged."}]},{"id":"blk-336","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-338","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-777","marks":["bold"],"text":"Laws (CC2 §2.1):"},{"id":"spn-778","text":" "},{"id":"spn-779","marks":["code"],"text":"A&B == B&A"},{"id":"spn-780","text":", "},{"id":"spn-781","marks":["code"],"text":"(A&B)&C == A&(B&C)"},{"id":"spn-782","text":", "},{"id":"spn-783","marks":["code"],"text":"A&A == A"},{"id":"spn-784","text":", "},{"id":"spn-785","marks":["code"],"text":"A&none == A"},{"id":"spn-786","text":"."}]}],"id":"blk-337","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-340","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-787","marks":["bold"],"text":"Cost:"},{"id":"spn-788","text":" resource rung "},{"id":"spn-789","marks":["bold"],"text":"adds"},{"id":"spn-790","text":" (two capabilities cost the sum); invariants "},{"id":"spn-791","marks":["bold"],"text":"conjoin"},{"id":"spn-792","text":" (κ must stay acyclic — a combine that creates a cycle is flagged "},{"id":"spn-793","marks":["code"],"text":"deliberate"},{"id":"spn-794","text":")."}]}],"id":"blk-339","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-341","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-795","marks":["code"],"text":"|>"},{"id":"spn-796","text":" — pipeline (sequence) → "},{"id":"spn-797","marks":["code"],"text":"chain"}]},{"id":"blk-342","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-798","text":"Governed sequential composition. "},{"id":"spn-799","marks":["bold"],"text":"The operator CC1 left lawless."}]},{"id":"blk-343","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-345","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-800","marks":["bold"],"text":"Laws (CC2 §2.2):"},{"id":"spn-801","text":" "},{"id":"spn-802","marks":["code"],"text":"(X|>f)|>g == X|>(f|>g)"},{"id":"spn-803","text":", "},{"id":"spn-804","marks":["code"],"text":"X|>id == X"},{"id":"spn-805","text":", "},{"id":"spn-806","marks":["bold"],"text":"not"},{"id":"spn-807","text":" commutative, "},{"id":"spn-808","marks":["bold"],"text":"not"},{"id":"spn-809","text":" idempotent."}]}],"id":"blk-344","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-347","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-810","marks":["bold"],"text":"Feasibility:"},{"id":"spn-811","text":" at each hand-off, producer "},{"id":"spn-812","marks":["code"],"text":"feeds_into"},{"id":"spn-813","text":" must match consumer "},{"id":"spn-814","marks":["code"],"text":"accepts_from"},{"id":"spn-815","text":", else the stage carries "},{"id":"spn-816","marks":["code"],"text":"0̲"},{"id":"spn-817","text":" and "},{"id":"spn-818","marks":["bold"],"text":"annihilates the whole pipeline"},{"id":"spn-819","text":" (alethic "},{"id":"spn-820","marks":["code"],"text":"consume"},{"id":"spn-821","text":"). A type-incompatible pipeline is not \"invalid\" — it *is* the zero of the composition."}]}],"id":"blk-346","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-349","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-822","marks":["bold"],"text":"Quantities (semiring):"},{"id":"spn-823","text":" confidence = product, cost = sum, worst-case latency = max, composed end-to-end; compared against each step's "},{"id":"spn-824","marks":["code"],"text":"requires"},{"id":"spn-825","text":" (epistemic β-gate)."}]}],"id":"blk-348","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-350","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-826","marks":["code"],"text":"⟲"},{"id":"spn-827","text":" — loop (PULSE nest)"}]},{"id":"blk-351","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-828","text":"Wrap a brick (or a "},{"id":"spn-829","marks":["code"],"text":"&"},{"id":"spn-830","text":"/"},{"id":"spn-831","marks":["code"],"text":"|>"},{"id":"spn-832","text":" tree) in a "},{"id":"spn-833","marks":["code"],"text":"retrieve → route → act → learn → consolidate"},{"id":"spn-834","text":" cadence. This is what attaches "},{"id":"spn-835","marks":["bold"],"text":"feedback"},{"id":"spn-836","text":" (the "},{"id":"spn-837","marks":["code"],"text":"learn"},{"id":"spn-838","text":" phase → "},{"id":"spn-839","marks":["code"],"text":"OutcomeSignal"},{"id":"spn-840","text":"/"},{"id":"spn-841","marks":["code"],"text":"ReputationUpdate"},{"id":"spn-842","text":" on the PULSE bus) and "},{"id":"spn-843","marks":["bold"],"text":"adaptation"},{"id":"spn-844","text":" ("},{"id":"spn-845","marks":["code"],"text":"consolidate"},{"id":"spn-846","text":" → "},{"id":"spn-847","marks":["code"],"text":"evolution.mjs evolve()"},{"id":"spn-848","text":"). Output is a "},{"id":"spn-849","marks":["code"],"text":"*.pulse.json"},{"id":"spn-850","text":" manifest, generated for free."}]},{"id":"blk-352","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-851","marks":["code"],"text":"0̲"},{"id":"spn-852","text":" — floor (implicit, on every operator)"}]},{"id":"blk-353","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-853","text":"Any sub-brick that violates an invariant or busts budget annihilates to "},{"id":"spn-854","marks":["code"],"text":"0̲"},{"id":"spn-855","text":" — it does "},{"id":"spn-856","marks":["bold"],"text":"not"},{"id":"spn-857","text":" down-rank the parent; it kills that branch (the same floor pattern Weave→govern already uses)."}]},{"id":"blk-354","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-858","marks":["bold"],"text":"Closure (why it's legos):"},{"id":"spn-859","text":" the bridge is closed under composition — composing governed verdicts yields a governed verdict with a merged certificate. So a tree of bricks exposes the *same* Brick interface and emits the *same* six PULSE tokens. A brick of bricks is a brick."}]},{"id":"blk-355","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-860","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-356","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-861","text":"4. The composite certificate"}]},{"id":"blk-357","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-862","marks":["code"],"text":"compose(tree)"},{"id":"spn-863","text":" returns one certificate for the whole assembly:"}]},{"id":"blk-358","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"{ decision: <winning plan | 0̲>,\n  cost:  { rung: join(parts), ... },     // Weave: whole-tree cost class\n  value: V(...),                          // alethic: conjoined feasibility + κ\n  permitted: <bridge verdict>,            // box-and-box select(): feasible ▸ permitted ▸ best\n  annihilated: [...0̲ branches with σ tags],\n  record: <evolution.mjs hash-chain entry> }"},{"id":"blk-359","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-864","text":"This is \"the verdict is the arithmetic\": the composite verdict is *computed*, not heuristic — cost from Weave, permission from the bridge, both over the same structural floor."}]},{"id":"blk-360","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-865","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-361","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-866","text":"5. v1 scope"}]},{"id":"blk-362","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-867","text":"Ordered so each slice is independently shippable and the risky/broad part comes last. "},{"id":"spn-868","marks":["bold"],"text":"Slice 0 is the narrow resource-rung path a second review (ChatGPT, on `weave-and-the-ampersand-stack.md`) recommends doing first and alone"},{"id":"spn-869","text":" — it is correct, and it is also exactly "},{"id":"spn-870","marks":["code"],"text":"Brick.cost"},{"id":"spn-871","text":", so it serves both goals."}]},{"id":"blk-363","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-872","marks":["bold"],"text":"Slice 0 — the certificate (do this first, ships value on its own):"},{"id":"spn-873","text":" 1. "},{"id":"spn-874","marks":["code"],"text":"weave/src/weave-certificate.mjs"},{"id":"spn-875","text":" — given Weave IR, emit a deterministic "},{"id":"spn-876","marks":["code"],"text":"WeaveCostCertificate"},{"id":"spn-877","text":" (§2.1): IR hash, analyzer identity+version, "},{"id":"spn-878","marks":["code"],"text":"costClass"},{"id":"spn-879","text":"/"},{"id":"spn-880","marks":["code"],"text":"ealDepth"},{"id":"spn-881","text":"/"},{"id":"spn-882","marks":["code"],"text":"polynomialDegree"},{"id":"spn-883","text":", fail-closed "},{"id":"spn-884","marks":["code"],"text":"resourceDecision"},{"id":"spn-885","text":". Pure, no new runtime. 2. Tests ("},{"id":"spn-886","marks":["code"],"text":"weave/test/"},{"id":"spn-887","text":"): cheap/poly term → "},{"id":"spn-888","marks":["code"],"text":"allow"},{"id":"spn-889","text":"; expensive term → "},{"id":"spn-890","marks":["code"],"text":"escalate"},{"id":"spn-891","text":"; unknown/rejected term → "},{"id":"spn-892","marks":["code"],"text":"annihilate"},{"id":"spn-893","text":"; "},{"id":"spn-894","marks":["bold"],"text":"hash changes when IR changes"},{"id":"spn-895","text":" (binding test). 3. Harden the "},{"id":"spn-896","marks":["code"],"text":"surface/weave_govern.exs"},{"id":"spn-897","text":" → "},{"id":"spn-898","marks":["code"],"text":"box-and-box"},{"id":"spn-899","text":" resource-rung path to consume the certificate (not re-parse strings), and assert "},{"id":"spn-900","marks":["code"],"text":"0̲"},{"id":"spn-901","text":" annihilation happens *before* utility can resurrect an option. Update "},{"id":"spn-902","marks":["code"],"text":"proofs/"},{"id":"spn-903","text":" receipts: certified-cheap wins & runs · high-utility exponential annihilated · uncertified annihilated · refused plan run manually detonates."}]},{"id":"blk-364","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-904","marks":["bold"],"text":"Slice 1+ — the compose runtime (the lego layer, on top of Slice 0):"},{"id":"spn-905","text":" 4. "},{"id":"spn-906","marks":["code"],"text":"box-and-box/compose.mjs"},{"id":"spn-907","text":" — "},{"id":"spn-908","marks":["code"],"text":"composeAnd"},{"id":"spn-909","text":", "},{"id":"spn-910","marks":["code"],"text":"composePipe"},{"id":"spn-911","text":", "},{"id":"spn-912","marks":["code"],"text":"composeTree"},{"id":"spn-913","text":", lifting "},{"id":"spn-914","marks":["code"],"text":"combine"},{"id":"spn-915","text":"/"},{"id":"spn-916","marks":["code"],"text":"chain"},{"id":"spn-917","text":"/"},{"id":"spn-918","marks":["code"],"text":"consume"},{"id":"spn-919","text":" from Values to Bricks, with the "},{"id":"spn-920","marks":["code"],"text":"feeds_into"},{"id":"spn-921","text":"/"},{"id":"spn-922","marks":["code"],"text":"accepts_from"},{"id":"spn-923","text":" check and semiring quantity composition. 5. "},{"id":"spn-924","marks":["code"],"text":"test/compose-laws.mjs"},{"id":"spn-925","text":" — CC2 §2 conformance (assoc/idem/identity for "},{"id":"spn-926","marks":["code"],"text":"&"},{"id":"spn-927","text":"; assoc/identity + infeasible⇒"},{"id":"spn-928","marks":["code"],"text":"0̲"},{"id":"spn-929","text":" for "},{"id":"spn-930","marks":["code"],"text":"|>"},{"id":"spn-931","text":"). Property-tested, same harness as the 103. 6. Forge surface: brick palette + canvas; snap with "},{"id":"spn-932","marks":["code"],"text":"& | ⟲"},{"id":"spn-933","text":"; the six panels retarget to the *selected composite* (Certificate = whole-tree cost, Governance = bridge over the tree, Evolve = mutate the tree); "},{"id":"spn-934","marks":["bold"],"text":"+ a Feedback panel"},{"id":"spn-935","text":" ("},{"id":"spn-936","marks":["code"],"text":"learn"},{"id":"spn-937","text":"→"},{"id":"spn-938","marks":["code"],"text":"OutcomeSignal"},{"id":"spn-939","text":"). 7. A worked demo: a 3-brick coalition ("},{"id":"spn-940","marks":["code"],"text":"retrieve |> certify |> govern"},{"id":"spn-941","text":") composed, certified, governed, evolved — the [&] stack composing *itself*."}]},{"id":"blk-365","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-942","marks":["bold"],"text":"Conservative composite-cost rule (CC2 §2.2; keep simple, don't overbuild):"},{"id":"spn-943","text":" any uncertified child ⇒ the composed plan is uncertified ("},{"id":"spn-944","marks":["code"],"text":"0̲"},{"id":"spn-945","text":"); "},{"id":"spn-946","marks":["code"],"text":"costClass"},{"id":"spn-947","text":" = the max (worst) over children; numeric budgets "},{"id":"spn-948","marks":["bold"],"text":"sum"},{"id":"spn-949","text":" along "},{"id":"spn-950","marks":["code"],"text":"|>"},{"id":"spn-951","text":" (cost), "},{"id":"spn-952","marks":["bold"],"text":"product"},{"id":"spn-953","text":" for confidence, "},{"id":"spn-954","marks":["bold"],"text":"max"},{"id":"spn-955","text":" for latency. The certificate format must leave room for this — it does (§2.1) — but the multi-plan resolver itself is Slice 1, not Slice 0."}]},{"id":"blk-366","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-956","marks":["bold"],"text":"Out (v1):"}]},{"id":"blk-367","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-369","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-957","text":"Cross-agent "},{"id":"spn-958","marks":["bold"],"text":"strategic"},{"id":"spn-959","text":" ability ("},{"id":"spn-960","marks":["code"],"text":"⟨⟨agents⟩⟩◊ ensure"},{"id":"spn-961","text":", CC2 §3) — coalition admissibility against an adversary. v2."}]}],"id":"blk-368","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-371","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-962","text":"Common-knowledge / coordinated-attack epistemic check (CC2 §3). v2."}]}],"id":"blk-370","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-373","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-963","text":"CloudEvents transport on the PULSE bus ("},{"id":"spn-964","marks":["code"],"text":"UMBRELLA.md"},{"id":"spn-965","text":" item 5). Keep the local hash-chain substrate; wire transport later."}]}],"id":"blk-372","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-375","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-966","text":"A real interpositional "},{"id":"spn-967","marks":["code"],"text":"run"},{"id":"spn-968","text":" host. Out — that's a separate stage."}]}],"id":"blk-374","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-376","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-969","marks":["bold"],"text":"Connects to, must not skip:"},{"id":"spn-970","text":" the "},{"id":"spn-971","marks":["code"],"text":"govern"},{"id":"spn-972","text":" bridge ("},{"id":"spn-973","marks":["code"],"text":"box-and-box compile"},{"id":"spn-974","text":"/"},{"id":"spn-975","marks":["code"],"text":"govern"},{"id":"spn-976","text":") is the dependency; compose sits *on top* of it. The first technical task is lawful "},{"id":"spn-977","marks":["code"],"text":"|>"},{"id":"spn-978","text":" (item 1) — small and self-contained."}]},{"id":"blk-377","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-979","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-378","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-980","text":"6. Review checklist (against CC2 before any code)"}]},{"id":"blk-379","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-381","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-981","text":"[ ] Does "},{"id":"spn-982","marks":["code"],"text":"Brick"},{"id":"spn-983","text":" faithfully carry CC2 §2.1's holder + contract, and is "},{"id":"spn-984","marks":["code"],"text":"&"},{"id":"spn-985","text":" still idempotent with the holder tag as provenance (not a tiebreak)?"}]}],"id":"blk-380","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-383","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-986","text":"[ ] Does "},{"id":"spn-987","marks":["code"],"text":"|>"},{"id":"spn-988","text":" match CC2 §2.2 exactly: associative, "},{"id":"spn-989","marks":["code"],"text":"id"},{"id":"spn-990","text":" identity, non-commutative, infeasible⇒"},{"id":"spn-991","marks":["code"],"text":"0̲"},{"id":"spn-992","text":", semiring quantities?"}]}],"id":"blk-382","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-385","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-993","text":"[ ] Is the composite cost the "},{"id":"spn-994","marks":["bold"],"text":"join"},{"id":"spn-995","text":" of parts' Weave rungs (not a re-measurement)?"}]}],"id":"blk-384","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-387","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-996","text":"[ ] Are the new laws a strict superset check over the existing 103 (no contradiction with "},{"id":"spn-997","marks":["code"],"text":"combine"},{"id":"spn-998","text":"/"},{"id":"spn-999","marks":["code"],"text":"chain"},{"id":"spn-1000","text":"/"},{"id":"spn-1001","marks":["code"],"text":"consume"},{"id":"spn-1002","text":" laws)?"}]}],"id":"blk-386","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-389","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-1003","text":"[ ] Is v1 honest about what it is *not* (no strategic/epistemic coalition admissibility yet)?"}]}],"id":"blk-388","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-390","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-1004","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-391","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-1005","text":"7. What this ships for the stack"}]},{"id":"blk-392","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-1006","text":"It closes the "},{"id":"spn-1007","marks":["code"],"text":"compose"},{"id":"spn-1008","text":" stage — the last lawless stage of the umbrella — at the runtime+surface level, advancing "},{"id":"spn-1009","marks":["code"],"text":"UMBRELLA.md"},{"id":"spn-1010","text":" \"what done looks like\" items 3 ("},{"id":"spn-1011","marks":["code"],"text":"|>"},{"id":"spn-1012","text":" carries laws/holders/annihilation) and partway 4. It turns the Forge from a λ-term playground into the "},{"id":"spn-1013","marks":["bold"],"text":"authoring surface for CC2 coalitions"},{"id":"spn-1014","text":", where the demo composes the portfolio's own engines. And it does so as a *thin lift* over already-shipped, already-property-tested algebra — not a new language."}]}],"edges":[],"id":"bagaaierals46iezz34t2rhluxsuc2pbtz6rby4pk54mbpsswdmgxh34q4ria","vocabulary":"ampersand.docs.fs.v1"}